Revert upstream e383171ff1c0f7b5b37f05f2bb67f7c5282b087f, "rendervulkan: make the shared
output images on first use" (3.16.29 and later, present in 3.17.0).

ValveSoftware/gamescope#2455: three NVIDIA users report Big Picture corruption, tearing and
flicker from 3.16.29 on; one bisect names this commit, and reverting it fixed that machine.
It also decides when the output images that 0005 allocates through GBM are created.
Reverting restores creation at init, as in the 3.16.23.6 build accepted on hardware.

